WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:01.980
- What did you wanna be when you grew up?

00:00:01.980 --> 00:00:04.587
- Are your parents disappointed of you?

00:00:08.992 --> 00:00:11.575
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.196 --> 00:00:17.863
(playful music)

00:00:18.740 --> 00:00:20.810
- What was your dream
job when you were a kid?

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.880
- When I was a kid, I wanted to be a chef.

00:00:22.880 --> 00:00:24.053
- Are you a chef now?

00:00:24.310 --> 00:00:25.760
- I'm a food studies major.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.160
- That makes no sense to me.

00:00:27.774 --> 00:00:29.824
- What did you wanna be when you grew up?

00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:31.283
- A taxi driver.

00:00:31.320 --> 00:00:33.083
- My dream job was being a lawyer.

00:00:33.530 --> 00:00:34.513
- What are you now?

00:00:34.770 --> 00:00:35.923
- Interaction design.

00:00:36.070 --> 00:00:37.233
- Are you a lawyer now?

00:00:37.580 --> 00:00:38.803
- I am not a lawyer now.

00:00:38.940 --> 00:00:40.793
- Do you even drive a car?

00:00:41.050 --> 00:00:42.691
- No, I cannot drive.

00:00:42.691 --> 00:00:43.610
(laughs)

00:00:43.610 --> 00:00:45.160
- You're really bummin' me out.

00:00:45.850 --> 00:00:48.300
- So what was your dream
job when you were a kid?

00:00:48.530 --> 00:00:50.980
- So like most kids, I
wanted to be an astronaut.

00:00:51.240 --> 00:00:52.753
- I wanted to be an astronaut.

00:00:53.320 --> 00:00:54.823
- Are you a astronaut now?

00:00:54.970 --> 00:00:56.870
- No, I'm actually a yogi teacher now.

00:00:56.870 --> 00:00:58.220
Like I'm a yogi instructor.

00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:59.770
- I'm still tryin' to figure it out.

00:00:59.770 --> 00:01:01.578
- Well, I wanted to be an architect.

00:01:01.578 --> 00:01:03.201
- What does that even mean?

00:01:03.201 --> 00:01:06.167
- Architect would design buildings.

00:01:06.400 --> 00:01:07.950
- That's all I need to hear, sir.

00:01:07.950 --> 00:01:08.783
- Okay.

00:01:08.783 --> 00:01:10.223
- Why did you give up your dream?

00:01:10.730 --> 00:01:13.367
- I lost interest in
what I wanted as a kid.

00:01:13.510 --> 00:01:15.323
- That sounds like a excuse.

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:18.433
- I research Amish women
and ultra-Orthodox women.

00:01:18.560 --> 00:01:20.360
- Are you trying to put me to sleep?

00:01:21.270 --> 00:01:22.830
- Why did you give up on your dream?

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:24.573
- I didn't really give up on my dream,

00:01:24.573 --> 00:01:26.563
it just sorta changed.

00:01:26.610 --> 00:01:28.860
- So what was your dream
job when you were a kid?

00:01:28.860 --> 00:01:30.273
- I wanted to be a
dancer when I was a kid.

00:01:30.273 --> 00:01:31.793
- Are you a dancer now?

00:01:31.810 --> 00:01:32.643
- I am.

00:01:32.770 --> 00:01:34.080
- Congratulations, you did it.

00:01:34.080 --> 00:01:34.913
- Thanks.

00:01:34.913 --> 00:01:36.872
(laughs)

00:01:38.995 --> 00:01:42.013
- When I was a kid, I
had a million dreams.

00:01:42.640 --> 00:01:45.463
But one of them was to be a taxi driver.

00:01:46.070 --> 00:01:48.090
- So are you a taxi driver now?

00:01:48.090 --> 00:01:49.140
- I never did become.

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.300
It was a dream when I was much younger

00:01:51.670 --> 00:01:54.693
and dreams change as you go
through different things.

00:01:54.810 --> 00:01:56.363
- Do you have any other dreams?

00:01:56.560 --> 00:01:58.203
- I have a million dreams.

00:01:58.570 --> 00:02:00.420
- I think you could reach your dream.

00:02:00.578 --> 00:02:02.820
- Wow, I'm glad that you said that.

00:02:02.820 --> 00:02:04.253
It gives me more confidence.

00:02:04.574 --> 00:02:07.241
(playful music)

00:02:15.190 --> 00:02:16.340
- Hey, Unsolved is on a new channel

00:02:16.340 --> 00:02:17.173
and now your part.

00:02:17.173 --> 00:02:18.040
- Subscribe here.

00:02:18.040 --> 00:02:19.163
That was my part.

